---
layout: default
title: Component Builder Test
sitemap: false
portside: components
---
<%= render PageHero.new(
  eyebrow: "require 'headius/component_builder'",
  heading: "Build this page from components!!!",
  body: "This temporary page exercises the component data that **Portside** can edit without exposing ERB.\n\nIts content is stored directly in ERB while the site remains responsible for presentation.",
  image: "/images/he-logo.svg",
  image_alt: "Headius Enterprises",
  actions: [
    {
      label: "View services",
      url: "/services",
      style: "primary"
    },
    {
      label: "Contact us",
      url: "/contact",
      style: "ghost"
    }
  ]
) %>

<%= render HomeContact.new(
  heading: "Blah Contact",
  body: "Hey there.",
  details: []
) %>

<%= render PageVideoGallery.new(
  heading: "Strongly typed list items",
  intro: "Each video has a title, public link, embed link, and background image.",
  videos: [
    {
      title: "Do More With Ruby",
      video_url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Pi20lQ1gG8",
      embed_url: "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/3Pi20lQ1gG8",
      background: "/images/yt_jruby_do_more_with_ruby.jpg"
    }
  ]
) %>

<%= render PageGroup.new(
  heading: "Nested components",
  intro: "Cards below are child components. Portside can add, delete, and reorder them.",
  highlighted: true
) do %>
  <%= render PageCard.new(
    title: "Markdown content",
    image: "",
    image_alt: "",
    link_label: "Read the blog",
    link_url: "/blog"
  ) do %>
Each card owns a **Markdown** field and optional image and link fields.
  <% end %>

  <%= render PageCard.new(
    title: "Site-owned presentation",
    image: "/images/jruby-logo.svg",
    image_alt: "JRuby",
    link_label: "About Headius",
    link_url: "/about"
  ) do %>
The component template controls the rendered HTML, so the editing UI does not need to reproduce the site's design.
  <% end %>
<% end %>

<%= render PageGroup.new(
  heading: "",
  intro: "",
  highlighted: false
) do %>
  <%= render PageCard.new(
    title: "More",
    image: "",
    image_alt: "",
    link_label: "",
    link_url: ""
  ) do %>
**Sometimes** things are needed. Sometimes not.
  <% end %>

  <%= render PageCard.new(
    title: "And more",
    image: "",
    image_alt: "",
    link_label: "",
    link_url: ""
  ) do %>
Blah blah blah
  <% end %>
<% end %>
